# Token-efficiency: keep generated lockfiles out of diffs and language stats.
# `-diff` suppresses the patch text in `git diff` / review surfaces (agents stop
# reading thousands of mechanical lines); `linguist-generated` collapses them in
# GitHub diffs and excludes them from language detection. They stay tracked.

# Node lockfiles
**/package-lock.json   linguist-generated -diff
**/yarn.lock           linguist-generated -diff

# Python lockfile (uv)
uv.lock                linguist-generated -diff

# Swift Package Manager resolved versions
**/Package.resolved    linguist-generated -diff

# Generated coverage / build reports, if ever committed
**/coverage.xml        linguist-generated -diff
